# Cloudflare Pages edge redirects. Copied verbatim into apps/docs/out/
# by Next.js's static-export step, then read by CF Pages at deploy time.
#
# The docs Next.js app has no app/page.tsx (only [lang]/page.tsx), so
# without a redirect docs.agenthost.pro/ would 404. fumadocs sets
# `hideLocale: "default-locale"` on i18n, but that only applies inside
# the app — at the static-hosting layer we still need to point bare /
# at /en/ explicitly.
/    /en/    302
